{"text": "Jour six ! Aujourd'hui, la ville construit tout ce qui attendait dans la file. L'h\u00f4pital est enfin termin\u00e9 : un grand b\u00e2timent blanc avec h\u00e9liport et ambulances. I-Abdhi en est la cheffe. Voici le parc de Lacsorbx : un \u00e9tang, une fontaine, une aire de jeux, un kiosque et des bancs partout. Patoche re\u00e7oit son port, avec son bateau et un \u00e9norme bateau de croisi\u00e8re : la compagnie Patoche ! Et Nostr a sa maison de glace, avec ses pingouins. Partie deux : un a\u00e9roport, une ferme, un bar, une base militaire et une salle d'arcade !", "timing": [38.582857, [0.0, 0.104, 0.186, 0.221, 0.267, 0.325, 0.372, 0.499, 0.58, 0.824, 0.906, 1.602, 1.718, 1.788, 1.846, 1.892, 1.916, 1.962, 2.02, 2.055, 2.113, 2.136, 2.287, 2.403, 2.531, 2.589, 2.635, 2.694, 2.728, 2.798, 2.821, 2.844, 2.868, 2.891, 2.926, 2.984, 3.019, 3.077, 3.123, 3.17, 3.204, 3.262, 3.286, 3.344, 3.39, 3.448, 3.483, 3.518, 3.541, 3.576, 3.622, 3.669, 3.704, 3.738, 3.785, 3.82, 3.866, 3.889, 3.913, 3.971, 4.017, 4.063, 4.098, 4.122, 4.145, 4.168, 4.191, 4.226, 4.249, 4.272, 4.296, 4.319, 4.354, 4.423, 4.481, 4.609, 4.667, 4.818, 4.934, 5.747, 5.817, 5.851, 5.886, 5.921, 5.979, 6.06, 6.107, 6.188, 6.211, 6.258, 6.281, 6.304, 6.351, 6.42, 6.455, 6.513, 6.571, 6.629, 6.653, 6.687, 6.722, 6.769, 6.827, 6.885, 6.943, 7.012, 7.129, 7.245, 7.361, 7.802, 7.872, 7.906, 7.976, 8.034, 8.104, 8.15, 8.173, 8.197, 8.22, 8.266, 8.324, 8.394, 8.475, 8.533, 8.58, 8.603, 8.626, 8.661, 8.707, 8.766, 8.824, 8.847, 8.94, 9.021, 9.172, 9.23, 9.288, 9.334, 9.404, 9.474, 9.543, 9.601, 9.683, 9.764, 9.88, 9.927, 9.985, 10.008, 10.101, 10.147, 10.182, 10.217, 10.263, 10.321, 10.391, 10.437, 10.495, 10.542, 10.612, 10.646, 10.716, 10.925, 11.436, 11.552, 11.668, 11.714, 11.796, 11.865, 11.912, 12.005, 12.121, 12.272, 12.307, 12.376, 12.399, 12.423, 12.446, 12.469, 12.504, 12.55, 12.608, 12.655, 12.701, 12.794, 12.841, 12.864, 13.038, 13.131, 13.827, 13.897, 13.967, 14.025, 14.094, 14.153, 1